From: Philippe Normand <philn@igalia.com>
Subject: [PATCH] WebRTC: replace placeholder tracks in the negotiated source

Backport the upstream replaceTrack fixes. Reuse the existing RTP source
instead of constructing an unlinked one, and select between the temporary
silence/black source and the attached capture track via input-selector.

Upstream: https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/commit/94c71a81acc63caa5e5a291b38472cda2af07b8b
Upstream: https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/commit/4292cdb20b827b049f72728328019be61cfe7360

--- a/Source/WebCore/Modules/mediastream/gstreamer/GStreamerRtpSenderBackend.cpp
+++ b/Source/WebCore/Modules/mediastream/gstreamer/GStreamerRtpSenderBackend.cpp
@@ -149,7 +149,7 @@
